"CAPTCHA disabled, Untrusted users won't see the captcha (<a "
"href=\"@settings\">general CAPTCHA settings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"CAPTCHA breyttur út, ótrúgvir brúkarar síggja ikki CAPTCHA ( <a "
"href=\"@settings\">algemennar CAPTCHA-stillingar</a> )."

