"The source path %path is likely a valid path. It is preferred to <a "
"href=\"@url-alias\">create URL aliases</a> for existing paths rather "
"than redirects."
msgstr ""
"Keldustigið %path tykist vera ein líklegur giltur slóð. Tað er "
"frægari at <a href=\"@url-alias\">skapa URL-aliasar</a> fyri verandi "
"slóðir heldur enn at nýta víkingar (redirects)."

