msgid ""
"The Redirect module allows users to redirect from old URLs to new "
"URLs.   For more information, see the <a href=\":online\">online "
"documentation for Redirect</a>."
msgstr ""
"Modúlin Redirect ger teimum møguleika at vísa frá gomlum URL’um "
"til nýggjar URL’er. Fyrir at lesa meira, sí <a "
"href=\":online\">online-røktarhandbókina fyri Redirect</a>."

msgid ""
"Redirect is accessed from three tabs that help you manage <a "
"href=\":list\">URL Redirects</a>."
msgstr ""
"Omdirigering verður opnað frá trimum flísum, sum hjálpa tær at "
"umsita <a href=\":list\">URL-omleiðingar</a>."

