"Any user who can update this webform will still be able to <a "
"href=\":view_href\">view</a> and <a href=\":test_href\">test</a> this "
"webform with the administrative theme."
msgstr ""
"Allur brúkarin, sum kann dagføra hetta webform, fer framhaldandi at "
"kunna <a href=\":view_href\">síggja</a> og <a "
"href=\":test_href\">royna</a> hetta webform við amministarative "
"temainum."

