"If On (default), Colorbox will add a unique per-request token to the "
"gallery id to avoid images being added manually to galleries. The "
"token was added as a security fix but some see the old behavior as an "
"feature and this settings makes it possible to remove the token."
msgstr ""
"Um On (standard), fer Colorbox at leggja eitt einstakt "
"per-umbæn-token til gallerí-id’ið fyri at fyribyrgja, at myndir "
"verða settar handaliga inn í gallerí. Token’ið varð lagt til "
"sum trygdarviðgerð, men onkur metir gamlar atferðina sum ein "
"menning, og hesin stillingur ger tað møguligt at taka tokenið "
"burtur."

