msgstr "@parent umali via mysqli (Loysingarroynd)"

msgid ""
"The MySQLi module provides the connection between Drupal and a MySQL, "
"MariaDB or equivalent database using the mysqli PHP extension. For "
"more information, see the <a href=\":mysqli\">online documentation for "
"the MySQLi module</a>."
msgstr ""
"MySQLi-eindin veitir sambandið millum Drupal og eina MySQL-, MariaDB- "
"ella samsvarandi dátugrunn við nýtslu av mysqli PHP-umstøðunni. "
"Fyrir meiri upplýsingar, síggj <a href=\":mysqli\">online "
"dokumentasjónina fyri MySQLi-eindina</a>."

msgid ""
"Trigger a content access permission rebuild. This can be a potentially "
