"open/close state will be saved using <a "
"href=\":local_storage_href\">Local Storage</a>."
msgstr ""
"Um tú hakar av, verður opið/lukka-støðan hjá øllum <a "
"href=\":details_href\">Details</a>-elementum goymd við at brúka <a "
"href=\":local_storage_href\">Local Storage</a>."

