"Use this paragraph field's main entity as the webform submission's "
"source entity."
msgstr ""
"Brúka hesa paragraf-fjøldu sína høvuðeining sum keldueiningina "
"hjá tí webform-innsendingi."

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the current page's entity will be used as the webform "
"submission's source entity."
msgstr ""
"Um ikki er hakkað av, verður tann staka síðuens entitetur brúktur "
"sum upprunaentitetur fyri innsendan av webformi."

msgid ""
"This paragraph field's main entity will be used as the webform "
"submission's source entity."
msgstr ""
"Dizze paragraf-fjilds høvuðseind verður nýtt sum upprunueind fyri "
"webform-umsóknina."

