"CSV data that can't be converted to submission data will display a "
"warning. If checked, these warnings will be treated as errors and "
"prevent the submission from being created."
msgstr ""
"CSV-dátur, sum ikki kunnu umsetast til innsendingardátur, vísa eitt "
"ávaring. Verður hetta sett til, so verða hesar ávaringar "
"viðgjørdar sum Feilar og forða fyri, at innsendingin verður skapt."

