"Enter the absolute URL or root-relative path to the HTML/SVG file. The "
"HTML/SVG file must be publicly accessible using http:// or https://."
msgstr ""
"Skriva inn ta aleina URL-ið (absolute) ella ta grund-relativa "
"vegleiðingina (root-relative) til HTML-/SVG-fíluna. "
"HTML-/SVG-fíluna skal vera almennt atkomilig um http:// ella "
"https://."

